flowchart TD
    G[Professional goal] --> S[Strands Agent]
    S --> T1[execute_safe_vendor_work]
    S --> T2[get_authority_cut]
    S --> T3[execute_authorized_vendor_work]
    T1 --> C[Shared ControlPlane]
    T2 --> C
    T3 --> C
    H[External Human Principal] --> API[Authority API: approve / deny / revoke]
    API --> C
    C --> DAG[Action DAG + semantic authority atoms]
    DAG --> CUT[Exact minimum Authority Cut over policy bundles]
    CUT --> B[Protected-action gate]
    B --> X[Tool effects + receipts]
    API -->|correction| INV[Descendant invalidation]
    INV --> COMP[Compensate executed reversible effects]
    COMP --> B
    B --> IRR[Irreversible first-funds remains separately gated]
